		<query>
			<formula>A[] forall (i:int[0,N-1])(EV(i).Processing imply local_ticket[i])</formula>
			<comment>In all paths, whenever any vehicle i is in the Processing state, its identifier (id[i]) must be non-zero (valid).</comment>
			<option key="--diagnostic" value="1"/>
			<result outcome="success" type="quality" timestamp="2026-04-23 11:50:10 -0600">
				<option key="--diagnostic" value="1"/>
			</result>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>A[] forall (i:int[0,N-1]) (EV(i).Processing imply serv == local_ticket[i])</formula>
			<comment>For all paths, if vehicle i is in the Processing state, the current service token (serv) must match that vehicle's identifier (id[i]).</comment>
			<result outcome="success" type="quality" timestamp="2026-04-23 11:31:13 -0600">
			</result>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>A&lt;&gt; forall (i:int[0,N-1]) (EV(i).EVreq imply EV(i).Charging)
</formula>
			<comment>It is guaranteed that for all vehicles, if a vehicle enters the Request (EVreq) state, it will eventually transition to the Charging state.</comment>
			<result outcome="success" type="quality" timestamp="2026-01-15 06:47:18 -0700">
			</result>
		</query>
		<query>
			<formula>A[] forall (i:int[0,N-1]) forall (j:int[0,N-1]) i != j imply not (EV(i).EVreq &amp;&amp; EV(j).EVreq)</formula>
